<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>Browser Agent Dashboard</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
        :root { --browser-purple: #6f42c1; --artifact-blue: #0d6efd; }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--browser-purple), #4a148c);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 0;
        }
        .dashboard-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .playbook-step {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--browser-purple);
        }
        .artifact-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 10px;
        }
    </style>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<!-- Header -->
<div class="dashboard-card text-center">
<h1 class="display-4">🎬 Browser Agent</h1>
<p class="lead">opena6 ist ein FastAPI-basierter Agent zur automatisierten Web-Automation. Er führt Browser-Playbooks deterministisch aus, archiviert alle Artefakte (Screenshots, HTML, HAR, PDFs) und unterliegt strikten Compliance-Kontrollen (Domain-Allowlist, robots.txt-Beachtung, Rate-Limiting).</p>
<div class="mt-3">
<span class="badge bg-success">✅ Playwright Ready</span>
<span class="badge bg-info">Port 12352</span>
<span class="badge bg-secondary">browsep</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Browser Engines -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🌐 Verfügbare Browser</h3>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="artifact-box">
<h4>Chromium</h4>
<p class="mb-0">Headless/Headed</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="artifact-box">
<h4>Firefox</h4>
<p class="mb-0">Gecko Engine</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="artifact-box">
<h4>WebKit</h4>
<p class="mb-0">Safari Basis</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Playbook Actions -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>📋 Playbook Actions</h3>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>goto</strong> - Navigate zu URL
            </div>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>click</strong> - Element anklicken (selector)
            </div>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>fill</strong> - Formularfeld ausfüllen
            </div>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>screenshot</strong> - Screenshot erstellen
            </div>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>wait</strong> - Pause (ms)
            </div>
<div class="playbook-step">
<strong>extract</strong> - Daten extrahieren (selector, attribute)
            </div>
</div>
<!-- Artifacts -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>📦 Captured Artifacts</h3>
<ul class="list-group">
<li class="list-group-item">📸 <strong>Screenshots</strong> - PNG Format, vollständige Seite</li>
<li class="list-group-item">📄 <strong>HTML</strong> - DOM State nach jedem Schritt</li>
<li class="list-group-item">🌐 <strong>HAR Files</strong> - Network Traffic</li>
<li class="list-group-item">📕 <strong>PDF Export</strong> - Seiten-Snapshots</li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- Compliance -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔐 Compliance Controls</h3>
<div class="alert alert-info">- 🎬 Playwright-basierte Browser-Automation (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit)</div>
<div class="alert alert-info">🔐 Domain-Allowlist + robots.txt-Enforcement</div>
<div class="alert alert-info">📦 Artifact-Capture (Screenshots, HTML, HAR, PDFs)</div>
<div class="alert alert-info">♻️ Deterministische Playbook-Ausführung (wiederholbar)</div>
<div class="alert alert-info">Prometheus-Metriken + strukturierte JSONL-Logs</div>
</div>
<!-- Integration -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔗 Safepoint Integration</h3>
<p>Jede Playbook-Ausführung wird via <code>opena2</code> archiviert:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request-Payload (inkl. Playbook-Steps)</li>
<li>Response-Artifacts (Screenshots, HTML, HAR)</li>
<li>Execution-Logs (JSONL)</li>
<li>Prometheus-Metriken</li>
</ul>
</div>
<!-- API -->
<div class="dashboard-card">
<h3>🔌 API Endpoint</h3>
<div class="bg-dark text-light p-3 rounded">
<code>POST http://localhost:12352/run</code>
<pre class="mt-2 mb-0 text-light">{
  "request_id": "job-001",
  "steps": [
    {"action": "goto", "url": "https://example.org"},
    {"action": "screenshot", "full_page": true}
  ]
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>